  "102": {
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "inputs": {
      "text": "cinematic photorealistic film still, present-day small Midwest town, 35mm film grain, a knees-up documentary photograph of two women standing in the forecourt of a small county highway patrol post beside a two-lane highway, seen from the side at eye level. A woman in a forest-green highway patrol bomber jacket handcuffs a blonde woman in a dusty pink hoodie, standing close behind the blonde woman and holding the blonde woman's wrists together at the small of her back. One polished steel hinged handcuff is already locked on the blonde woman's right wrist, and the deputy presses the second hinged cuff closed around the blonde woman's left wrist with her thumb. The deputy, on the left of the frame, is a twenty-two-year-old woman with her dark espresso brown hair styled in glossy rockabilly victory-roll bangs and a high curled ponytail, a bold cherry-red dyed section running through the rolled bangs and down the curls of the ponytail, large polished gold hoop earrings, bright blue eyes, sharp black winged eyeliner and glossy red lipstick. She wears the Graystone County Sheriff's patrol uniform: a dark forest-green bomber jacket of smooth nylon twill with ribbed knit sleeve bands and waistband, zipped to the middle of her chest, a polished gold six-point star badge on its left chest and an embroidered vivid azure blue and gold patch on each upper sleeve; above the zipper, the pointed collar of a crisp tan uniform shirt and a vivid, saturated azure blue necktie with a small gold tie bar; a black leather duty belt with a polished brass buckle; tan riding breeches, the same khaki tan as her shirt, with a vivid azure blue stripe down the outer seam; and mirror-polished black leather thigh-high riding boots pulled up over the breeches to mid-thigh; her head is bare. She looks down at the handcuffs on the blonde woman's wrists with a cocky, satisfied little smirk. The woman being cuffed, on the right of the frame, is a twenty-three-year-old woman with long loose wavy honey-blonde hair and subtle natural makeup, in a soft dusty pink pullover hoodie with drawstrings and lightly torn blue jeans. She stands in profile facing right, her arms pulled behind her back, and looks back over her shoulder toward the camera with a tight-lipped, annoyed glare. Behind them stands a single-storey tan brick highway patrol post with a flat roof, a glass front door and a flagpole, a white patrol SUV with an azure blue stripe parked at the curb, and beyond it the empty two-lane highway running into flat green farmland and a distant grain elevator. Both women from the knees up, the handcuffs at the center of the frame and in sharp focus. Low late-afternoon sun from the left rims both women's hair and puts a bright glint on the polished steel handcuffs. Forest green, tan, azure blue, dusty pink and denim palette, natural skin texture, 35 mm lens.",
