ee-year-old streetracer, with long loose wavy honey-blonde hair and subtle natural makeup, in a soft dusty pink pullover hoodie with drawstrings and lightly torn blue jeans. She stands in profile facing right, her arms pulled behind her back, and looks back over her shoulder toward the camera with a tight-lipped, annoyed glare. Behind them stands a single-storey tan brick highway patrol post with a flat roof, a glass front door and a flagpole, a white patrol SUV with an azure blue stripe parked at the curb, and beyond it the empty two-lane highway running into flat green farmland and a distant grain elevator. Both women from the knees up, the handcuffs at the center of the frame and in sharp focus. Low late-afternoon sun from the left rims both women's hair and puts a bright glint on the polished steel handcuffs. Forest green, tan, azure blue, dusty pink and denim palette, natural skin texture, 35 mm lens.",
